      {
        "id": "RKXKT2DMA01A",
        "title": "Great coffee mugs",
        "body": "I got an espresso/latte machine for Christmas and needed some larger mugs for my lattes. We found these and I instantly loved the design and color of the mugs. They are true to the pictures and the color is accurate.The mug is large enough to fit my double shot lattes with some whipped cream on top. The handle is big enough for my hand to fit comfortably which is a huge plus. My husband said he can hold them comfortably as well.We keep ours out on display between uses because they are so pretty.So far they have held up and have no chips and the paint is still intact after numerous uses and washes.The mugs hold temperature just as well as any other mug I've used and we have enjoyed drinking our coffee out of them.",
        "body_html": "<div data-hook=\"reviewRichContentContainer\" lang=\"en-US\" class=\"_Y3Itd_contain-rich-content_2IORW\"><p><span>I got an espresso/latte machine for Christmas and needed some larger mugs for my lattes. We found these and I instantly loved the design and color of the mugs. They are true to the pictures and the color is accurate.</span></p><p><span>The mug is large enough to fit my double shot lattes with some whipped cream on top. The handle is big enough for my hand to fit comfortably which is a huge plus. My husband said he can hold them comfortably as well.</span></p><p><span>We keep ours out on display between uses because they are so pretty.</span></p><p><span>So far they have held up and have no chips and the paint is still intact after numerous uses and washes.</span></p><p><span>The mugs hold temperature just as well as any other mug I've used and we have enjoyed drinking our coffee out of them.</span></p></div>",
